{"id":"navernoe","lemma":"наверное","pos":"adv","rank":197,"glosses":["probably, most likely"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/af/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это, наверное, хорошая вещь.","en":"That's probably a good thing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/787190","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},{"g":"thing, object"}]},{"text":"Мы, наверное, пойдём.","en":"We'll probably go.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"}]},{"text":"Наверное, ты прав.","en":"You're probably right.","words":[null,{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Это, наверное, моя вина.","en":"It's probably my fault.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"guilt, fault"}]},{"text":"Он, наверное, об этом забыл.","en":"He probably forgot about it.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"about"},null,{"g":"to forget","l":"забыть"}]}]}